    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In: Define > Business need",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [
        "Conditions for performance of contracts"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [
        "Conditions for performance of contracts",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This regulation enables contracting authorities to incorporate special conditions relating to the performance of a contract, which may include economic, innovation, environmental, social or employment considerations. Such conditions must be linked to the subject-matter of the contract and must be indicated in the contract notice or in the procurement documents.",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "Conditions for performance of contracts",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Objective at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "Conditions for performance of contracts",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In identifying and assessing the relative complexity, risk and impact of the procurement, contracting authorities should consider whether to incorporate special conditions relevant to the performance of the contract.",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Conditions for performance of contracts",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Key considerations at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Conditions for performance of contracts",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Contracting authorities should:",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Conditions for performance of contracts",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "ensure that the incorporation of contract performance conditions is considered when assessing the relative complexity, risk and impact of the procurement",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "Conditions for performance of contracts",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "ensure that any contract performance conditions are linked to the subject-matter of the contract and do not have the effect of causing discrimination to suppliers or unfairly narrowing competition.",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "Conditions for performance of contracts",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Legal framework",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "Conditions for performance of contracts",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "There is no direct equivalent section in the Procurement Act 2023",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "Conditions for performance of contracts",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
